<title>UK: SNOOKER-LATEST SCORE IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-LATEST SCORE IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Score after the opening day of the best-of-35 frames world snooker championship final (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Ken Doherty (Ireland) leads 1-Stephen Hendry (Scotland) 11-5.</p>
</text>
